    "text_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 28 2025 16:25:22 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h4>Automate workflows, streamline compliance monitoring</h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">In Ambient Monitoring scenarios, the command center draws on near-real-time data from always-aware ambient sensors. It automates workflows, streamlines protocol compliance monitoring and delivers actionable insights that support proactive interventions.</span></p>\n<h4>Get a single source of truth for situational awareness</h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The command center unifies capabilities, systems and more, delivering predictive intelligence and enterprise-wide visibility to enable smarter, more human-centered care. The command center can integrate with a wide variety of systems like the EHR, nurse call, documentation tools, interpretation services and IoT devices.</span></p>\n<h4>Support flexibility in managing care delivery</h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The command center’s workflow orchestration tools support flexibility in managing aspects of care delivery like receiving and completing tasks or notifying team members.<br>\n </span>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jan 06 2026 15:53:30 GMT+0000",
